h3: State Change Hooks
Shell scripts executed on VRRP state changes. Click Edit to modify. Environment: $ACTION, $NAME, $TYPE.
| Name | 
| 01-ubus | [Edit]
| 01-user | [Edit]
<input> e.g., 60-vpn-failover
